        -:   41:// MIKE WILLIAMS TODO: convert all of the other stringly-typed IO plugin properties to use constants
        -:   42:namespace PCB_IO_LOAD_PROPERTIES
        -:   43:{
        -:   44:// Used to control whether the stackup of the board passed into the IO plugin is preserved or not.
        -:   45:// It will NOT keep the stackup from being changed in all cases, as a copper layer increase may require
